# AEGIS-X v3 — Non-negotiable Rules
1) UI/API read ONLY from engine_snapshot (no compute in UI/API).
2) engines/ are pure dict->dict functions (NO DB/SQL/HTTP/LLM inside).
3) DB writes ONLY via snapshot_repo / repo modules (single write path).
4) Safety priority: EmergencyStop > Retract > Mode > Strategy.
5) Every displayed datum must include source(real-name), timestamp, refresh_rate metadata.
6) Zero-Flash: location.reload() / window.location.reload() 금지. 부분 갱신만 fetch 또는 axios로 수행.

